Package: scrubadub
Title: Pre- and Post-Filtering UMAPs for Doublet and Low-Quality Cell Removal
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Benno", "Orr", email = "borr@broadinstitute.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Given a raw-cell PCA embedding and the same embedding refit
    after QC filtering, scrubadub lays out a UMAP of all raw cells (colored
    by why a cell was later dropped: flagged doublet vs. low-quality) next
    to a UMAP of the cells that survive both filters. Intended as a quick,
    honest before/after check on a doublet- or QC-filtering step, not a
    doublet caller itself -- bring your own doublet flag and keep/drop flag.
